<title>USA: TJ Intl sets shr buyback for option plan.</title>
<headline>TJ Intl sets shr buyback for option plan.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TJ International said that its board of directors approved a new stock option incentive plan for senior managers and the initiation of a $15 million buyback of the company's stock.</p>
<p>The new stock option plan authorized a total of 1.5 million shares which are anticipated to be granted during the next three years.</p>
<p>The stock buyback is planned to mitigate any dilution stemming from the new option plan and the expected stock purchase by senior managers.</p>
</text>
